           "Srikanth, Today is the agreed upon due date to finalization of Jbuilder configuration/setup.<br> Apart from the Jbuilder configuration we should have a document that describes the various AvocadoIT settings that have been done and what the best practices are.<br> Please ask Lisa to set up a meeting with all USA engineering on Monday evening or Tuesday so that you can present the information to the entire group.<br> Thanks",
           "meeting_propose_request"
          ],
          [
           "First of all, you are the man! I might have to stay in Dallas on Wed.<br> But I will let you know tomorrow afternoon.<br> I have a conf call at 2:30 pm with ATX and.<br> I may have a meeting with them on Wed in person if it goes well.<br> I will let you know.<br>",
           "meeting_propose_request"
          ],
          [
           "Amitabh - I talked to Matt this afternoon and understand that you will be driving deliverables for the Biogen project.<br> I talked to Ty this afternoon to let him know he would be project managing Biogen, i.<br>e.<br> dealing with Biogen, with yourself & Richard and the Accenture client team.<br> Given that Ty is brand new to the project, can we set aside some time tomorrow morning to talk thru status, issues, deliverables, due-dates, next steps, etc.<br> Once I get your availability, I will check with Ty and Richard on theirs, so we can have an internal kick-off meeting.<br> Thanks! Amit.<br>",
           "meeting_propose_request"
          ],
          [
           "\"FYI, We have been changing meetings like crazy around here and this has created some confusion about what meetings are when.<br> The current strategy on Sales Con Calls is: 1.<br> Venk is having one on one calls each week with each rep and their sales manager.<br> This takes the place of the old \"\"forecast\"\" con calls.<br> 2.<br> We have a weekly sales managers meeting con call on Friday's at 11:00 to talk about issues, big deals and other important topics.<br> Optional attendees for this call are finance, legal, training and I just added Lisa, and Chris has always been on it.<br> 3.<br> On Mondays at 8am, we have a tentative con call/meeting scheduled.<br> This is normally used for special announcements or training.<br> There is an announcement sent out on Friday to all attendees regarding the status and topics for the call.<br> There is also an announcement sent out if there is NOT going to be a call.<br> I just added Lisa to the list for this one, and Chris has always been on it.<br> Hope this helps,\"",
           "meeting_propose_request"
          ],
          [
           "Tim, It's great to hear from you! Sure, we can schedule a meeting for late next week.<br> I am available on Thursday after 1:00 PM PST.<br> Will a meeting from 1:00 to 2:00 PM PST work for you and your Internet Group? Please let me know.<br>",
           "meeting_propose_request"
          ],
          [
           "DEAR Brett Welborn: We, at Mindmaker, wish to thank you for the interest you expressed in our products at Comdex.<br> As you know, we have developed many technologies useful for intelligent PC and Web-based computing as explained on our web-site at www.<br>mindmaker.<br>com.<br> Please feel free to contact us at any time to request further information about any of these technologies at 408-467-9200.<br> I will be calling you in the near future to field any questions you have, send more data sheets, and, if appropriate, arrange a follow-up meeting.<br> If you can provide more details about your own needs and applications, we can respond with more specific implementations.<br> We look forward to beginning a fruitful dialogue between our companies.<br>",
           "meeting_propose_request"
          ],
          [
           "We can make 1:00.<br> We will come to your office at that time.<br> I have a meeting that finishes around the same time so we may be a few minutes late (not more than 15).<br> Do you know what the best way is to get to your office from Great America Parkway? Thanks.<br>",
           "meeting_propose_request"
          ],
          [
           "We will have a short meeting in the Training Room at 210pm today for a brief moment of silence for the families of those affected by the tragic events that have occurred today.<br>, please plan on attending if you are in San Jose.<br>",
           "meeting_propose_request"
          ],
          [
           "Ron, Thanks for your answers to my questions.<br> If we can try to schedule a face-to-face meeting over the next week, that would be helpful.<br> If you can bring a technical resource with you, I'll involve an engineer on my side.<br> Right now, next Monday PM, Wednesday PM, and Friday PM look clear enough to fit in a 1.<br>5-2 hour meeting.<br>",
           "meeting_propose_request"
          ],
          [
           "I have a meeting at NextLink tomorrow morning, then an off-site with another vendor in Santa Clara at 2:00 PM.<br> Call me on my cell if you need me.<br>",
           "meeting_propose_request"
          ],
          [
           "Venk - I will be in London Sept 4-7 (departing 9am on the 7th).<br> Kimberlie and David Shrigley are speaking at 8am on Tuesday, Sept 5, and we have a meeting scheduled with European Digital Partners (affiliated with KKR) for Wed, Sept 6 at 10am.<br> I suggest that we hold a team dinner in London Tuesday night.<br> Details for the conference are as follows: www.<br>getstartup.<br>com Shaw Park Plaza Hotel 011 44 207 666 9000 (Rene's travel agent booked this for me - I think Shrigley stays at the Four Seasons in London, which is where I used to stay 10 years ago when I was on the AirTouch expense account.<br>)",
           "meeting_propose_request"
          ],
          [
           "Lisa had arranged several 1x1 but did not give me a schedule.<br> Unfortunately she is at home sick today.<br> We have an eStaff meeting in the afternoon that Venk just called for.<br> So, I may have to reschedule some of the 1X1s.<br> Please let me know if your 1x1 falls between 10:45 and 12:00 or from 1:00 - 4:00.<br> We will either do it after 4:00 or on Monday.<br> Sorry for the confusion",
           "meeting_propose_request"
          ],
          [
           "Hi George, Can you please send me the logistical information for the Openwave meeting at 10:00 AM this coming Thursday? I want to be sure that Prakash has it.<br> Also, were you going to schedule a meeting with Sybase for this week? If so, please be sure and let me know.<br> Please keep me in the loop relative to Prakash's calendar OK? I can help both of you a lot! :-) Thanks!",
           "meeting_propose_request"
          ],
          [
           "I'd like to have our Monday manager's meeting at 10:15 today.<br> Agenda to follow.<br>",
           "meeting_propose_request"
          ],
          [
           "Wed afternoon between 4pm and 6pm is open for now.<br> However, I may have an E*Trade meeting so how about 5pm or 5:30pm on Wed ?",
           "meeting_propose_request"
          ],
          [
           "sounds easy enough; call me quickly to discuss--I have an 11 o'clock meeting that may take alot of the afternoon so let's talk before that",
           "meeting_propose_request"
          ],
          [
           "I have an agenda item, but I think I'll schedule a separate meeting for it, so as not to waste the time of several folks for whom it doesn't concern.<br>.<br> (I'm mentioning it now so your meeting can avoid unnecessary doc items) The item is prioritization of the major doc work for 4/5.<br>.<br> Prakash wants me to go through the major doc work with the key managers as a group and get agreement on what things will get the focus for this release.<br> (Although to be honest, in 3 weeks there won't be much difference between pieces that have focus and pieces that don't.<br>) I'll try to schedule it for Friday since none of the participants are outside North America.<br>",
           "meeting_propose_request"
          ],
          [
           "What happened to this meeting.<br> Did we ever try to set up this meeting with someone from CG&Y or Andersen who has done a Vitria integration? We need to do this and decide as to what we should do with Vitria/TIBCO etc.<br>",
           "meeting_propose_request"
          ],
          [
           "The 2.<br>5 Release is going GA on Jan 15th.<br> Many of us have been anxiously waiting for the next release.<br> It is finally here and it is not called Release 3.<br>0.<br> (It is unnamed so I shall call it Release 2.<br>6) Time Frame: March 19 GA The three major items missing from this list on which people are working on today are Pocket PC, VoiceXML and Caching.<br> These are going into Release 3.<br>0 which is tentatively scheduled for July end.<br> Since these features are quite extensive we have to allocate resources on these tasks now in order to finish then for release 3.<br>0.<br> Will we have a pocket PC solution before Release 3.<br>0? Absolutely.<br> We are recommending people to use the PDA adapter for building Pocket PC.<br> We will have a R&D group meeting (after the holidays) to talk about all the 2.<br>6 features is more detail.<br>",
           "meeting_propose_request"
          ],
          [
           "I have this meeting on my calendar at 4pm Toronto time - 1pm San Jose time.<br> The version in my calendar does not have any of the contact information.<br> Will the real meeting please stand up? ;) I know there have been a number of changes.<br> I seem to recall that the 10am meeting was moved because nobody could make it.<br> I'm pretty sure (70%) that 4pm is the new time.<br> Can anyone out there confirm?",
           "meeting_propose_request"
          ],
          [
           "Sure Prakash, I will forward the invitation to Richard.<br> Geoff is part of '3.<br>5_AlwaysOn' via 'R&DManagers'.<br> I will make sure that both Geoff and Richard are uptodate on offline activities in San Jose.<br> If you want me to setup a meeting for Geoff - to bring him up to speed, please let me know.<br>",
           "meeting_propose_request"
          ],
          [
           "Hi Dan, We are going to set up a meeting with HP Bluestone for them to see a technology presentation and a demo of the EMDS.<br> If the timing works out, do you think that you could help support it? I waiting to see when they are available.<br>",
           "meeting_propose_request"
          ],
          [
           "Hideki, Can you schedule a meeting in out look, with what bugs or item we want to discuss?",
           "meeting_propose_request"
          ],
          [
           "Hi Grant, Here is the info.<br> on Paul.<br> Send him an e-mail to set up a meeting.<br> I will send on the Credit Ass.<br> info and the Lead Profile later.<br> Remember, he wants to make a decision within the next month or so, has talked to NetMorph, Envion, and Visionaire, not sure about those spellings.<br> Also he isn't sure about which devices yet.<br> He wants to render Time and Expense as a module and also their calendars and maybe use notfications.<br> All this web content exists (Windows NT Sequel Database).<br> He wants a company with an established market record, and existing customers.<br> Good luck!",
           "meeting_propose_request"
          ],
          [
           "Lisa, Could you set up a 30 minute meeting between Prakash and myself for some time this week? Prakash, do you want to schedule these bi-weekly (once in two weeks)?",
           "meeting_propose_request"
          ],
          [
           "I have already rescheduled most of these.<br> It just happened that I set up a breakfast meeting with you and David on Monday morning at 8am (Peppermill in Santa Clara) so that works out well.<br>",
           "meeting_propose_request"
          ],
          [
           "Ray: Would you be free to make a sales call on Thursday, August 9th? I set up a meeting with Progress Software out of Cambridge, MA.<br> This is not a hot lead.<br> I spoke with them today and they have some interest in wireless and would like to get an overview of EP, especially the technology.<br> The folks that would be attending would have a tech slant and would like for you to attend, if possible.<br> Let me know.<br>",
           "meeting_propose_request"
          ],
          [
           "Marcia, I have a meeting from 3:00 to 6:00 on Saturday.<br> And, I know a 40 minute meeting isn't long enough.<br> So, if earlier on Saturday doesn't work for you, let's do Sunday -- I'm completely open on Sunday.<br> Please name your preferred time and place, and I'll make it work.<br> Thanks for your flexibility.<br>",
           "meeting_propose_request"
          ],
          [
           "Helen, Attached is the notes that Alex took from the Blustone soft launch.<br> At the bottom of the email their are a few action items.<br> I have set up the first meeting with the E Speak group to discuss integration efforts between EP and HP.<br> That meeting will occur today.<br> Andy and Robert will be leads in this meeting.<br> They will qualify how we can integrate and also try to set up a meeting with Kevin Kilroy.<br> Does anyone on the Executive staff have a relationship with Kevin Kilroy?? That would help.<br>",
           "meeting_propose_request"
          ],
          [
           "I have been unable to fit in the MBO session this week - on your calendar.<br> I thought you wanted to have the portal strategy meeting at eStaff next week?! What are your priorities?",
           "meeting_propose_request"
          ],
          [
           "Jennifer, I apologize for the misconnect for the meeting that you wanted to hold today.<br> The best way to set up meetings with me and my team is to be sure that you have received a response from me confirming the meeting date, time and location.<br> For today's proposed meeting neither of these events occurred.<br> I was traveling nonstop for two weeks and missed your email requesting the meeting.<br> It looks as though Thursday, 7/20 at 3:30pm will work for us.<br> We can come to your site once we receive the address and a confirmation that your required team members can attend.<br>",
           "meeting_propose_request"
          ],
          [
           "I have a meeting that will probably go through 4:30.<br> Can we do this at 4:30 or later?",
           "meeting_propose_request"
          ],
          [
           "I have a meeting right now, I will come back and look at tit.<br>",
           "meeting_propose_request"
          ],
          [
           "We need to move the communications meeting from next Tuesday since Matt and Prakash will be in Chicago.<br> How about the 9th?",
           "meeting_propose_request"
          ],
          [
           "Hi Robert, I would like to set up a short meeting with our Director of Sales-Jeff Newman.<br> He will be in Canada on the week of 4/23 and would like to drop in.<br> AvocadoIT has had a lot of success helping customers like you increase revenue, decrease costs and increase field force productivity.<br> AvocadoIT is the leading mobile application provider, with nearly 100 highly referenceable customers and partners, including E*Trade, Fidelity, Alaska Airlines, America West Airlines, Accenture, Best Buy, Cap Gemini Ernst & Young, and Sun Microsystems.<br> We have helped each of these companies extend their customer reach and improve their employee productivity by mobilizing their existing information infrastructure to a broad range of wireless devices, including RIM pagers, Palm Pilots, WAP Phones, and voice.<br> Gain a strategic advantage over your competition.<br> Please let me know who I need to follow up with in your group to discuss in detail.<br> Thank you!",
           "meeting_propose_request"
          ],
          [
           "Julie, From our last conversation, I know that you will be trying to set a meeting up with AvocadoIT and the Jornada group.<br> I was wondering if you happen to know if the HP reps are being compensated for sales that are going through Aether?? Thanks for your help!",
           "meeting_propose_request"
          ],
          [
           "Would it be possible to move this meeting up an hour ie move it to 1pm PST?",
