         "customdata": [
          [
           "Could you all provide some feedback on your interview with Jim for the Business Applications Manager?",
           "request_feedback"
          ],
          [
           "Peter, I spoke with Don about SE hiring and he said I've got a yellow light - we can probably make a case for excellent candidates in the right geographical area.<br> Marc Salzman was referred to us by Larry Salerno in Chicago.<br> We've done 3 SE phone interviews and he seems to be a very good candidate.<br> Philip O'Connell did a face-to-face interview in NYC and liked him too, however Phil is gone as you know.<br> Can you take a look at this candidate and give me your feedback? In addition, we are finishing phone interviews with the ex-netmorph SE candidate in Atlanta.<br> If he passes all phone interviews then I'll send you his resume too.<br> If both candidates look good then we'll discuss which geographic area needs an SE.<br> Khou can help arrange interviews for you if needed and she has been keeping these candidates warm for us.<br> Thanx, Dan.<br>",
           "request_feedback"
